Converted locally by scripts/convert_hsface.py
----------------------------------------------
- HSFace10K face recognition weights, Vec2Face authors (BooBooWu/Vec2Face,
  fr_weights/hsface10k.pth) — MIT. The iResNet definition it loads comes from
  github.com/HaiyuWu/SOTA-Face-Recognition-Train-and-Test — MIT.
  HSFace10K is a synthetic dataset generated by Vec2Face, which was trained
  on WebFace4M; check the terms that apply to your use before going beyond
  research.

